    "id": "4486342f379c",
    "title": "【寫實主義的巔峰！新潮文庫經典再現】",
    "date": "2026-02-10",
    "datetime": "2026-02-10T03:41:46.000Z",
    "timestamp": 1770694906,
    "category": "文學與諾貝爾",
    "series": "",
    "seriesIndex": null,
