    "body": "赤豆鬆糕\n\n鬆糕是一種炊蒸而成的甜年糕，是浙江溫州的傳統點心，每年歲末「炊鬆糕」亦是溫州春節民俗之一。\n\n鬆糕用當年的純糯米，拌以醃漬過的肥肉丁，加桂花和白糖後炊蒸而成，外形鬆軟綿糯，口感甜中有咸。目前最有名氣的專業作坊應為始於1943年的「矮人鬆糕」。",
    "media": [
      "outputs/facebook_posts/_extracted/your_facebook_activity/posts/media/xingdongshangchuan_258193400861376/3003727572974598.jpg"
    ],
    "sourceFile": "your_facebook_activity/posts/your_posts__check_ins__photos_and_videos_1.json",
    "sourceFiles": [
      "your_facebook_activity/posts/your_posts__check_ins__photos_and_videos_1.json",
      "your_facebook_activity/posts/album/17.json"
    ],
