    "body": "#死過就是重生\n#敢死的氣魄\n\n生命最孤寂的時刻,\n就是眼看自己的世界分崩離析,\n卻只能茫然的望著.\n\nThe loneliset moment in someone's life is when they are watching\ntheir whole world fall apart, and all they can do is stare blankly.\n\nF. Scott Fitzgerald",
