    "category": "早期短貼與生活記錄",
    "series": "",
    "seriesIndex": null,
    "seriesTotal": null,
    "seriesUnit": "",
    "tags": [],
    "body": "#天才雷普利\n\nThe Talented Mr. Ripley is a 1999 American psychological thriller written for the screen and directed by Anthony Minghella. An adaptation of the 1955 Patricia Highsmith novel of the same name, the film stars Matt Damon as Tom Ripley, Jude Law as Dickie Greenleaf, Gwyneth Paltrow as Marge Sherwood and Cate Blanchett as Meredith Logue.\n\nThe novel was previously filmed as Plein Soleil in 1960.",
